{"step_index":151,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T00:07:58Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Cached Data Fields**\n\nFetched all the required business data successfully. Now reviewing the cached information to determine field completeness and identify potential areas requiring fallback strategies or data cleaning, specifically focusing on fields like postal codes. Proceeding to write a script that will merge the fetched data with original user input, ensuring the specified constraints are followed.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Inspection and merger script for 200 verified companies","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nconst inputFile = 'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e1493fa0-e8a4-4717-a46c-5bc1b3357473/scratch/input_batch.tsv';\nconst cacheFile = 'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e1493fa0-e8a4-4717-a46c-5bc1b3357473/scratch/bizno_200_cache.json';\n\nconst lines = fs.readFileSync(inputFile, 'utf-8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\nconst cache = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(cacheFile, 'utf-8'));\n\nconsole.log('Total input rows:', lines.length);\nconsole.log('Cached keys:', Object.keys(cache).length);\n\nlet closedCount = 0;\nlet zipCount = 0;\nlet empCount = 0;\nlet missingZip = [];\n\nlines.forEach((l, idx) => {\n  const p = l.split('\\t');\n  const bizno = p[3]?.trim();\n  const c = cache[bizno] || {};\n  \n  if (c.status === '폐업' || p[1]?.trim() === '폐업' || l.includes('\\t폐업\\t')) closedCount++;\n  if (c.zip) zipCount++;\n  else missingZip.push({ idx: idx + 1, company: p[2]?.trim(), bizno, addr: p[6]?.trim() });\n  if (c.employees) empCount++;\n});\n\nconsole.log('폐업자 수:', closedCount);\nconsole.log('우편번호 확보 수:', zipCount, '/ 200');\nconsole.log('종업원수 확보 수:', empCount, '/ 200');\nconsole.log('Missing zip count:', missingZip.length);\nif (missingZip.length > 0) {\n  console.log('First 5