{"step_index":177,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T00:09:36Z","thinking":"**Address Data Processing & Verification**\n\nAnalyzed the address data for `성현정밀`, successfully translating the Korean address to the corresponding postal code. Noted that the original table had empty address fields for `대아정밀` and `동이정공`, thus address and zip code data remains absent for these entities. Prepared to examine and classify the industry for all 200 items in the dataset.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst inputFile = 'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e1493fa0-e8a4-4717-a46c-5bc1b3357473/scratch/input_batch.tsv';\nconst cache = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e1493fa0-e8a4-4717-a46c-5bc1b3357473/scratch/bizno_200_cache.json', 'utf-8'));\nconst lines = fs.readFileSync(inputFile, 'utf-8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\n\nlet missingDae = [];\nlines.forEach((l, idx) => {\n  const p = l.split('\\t');\n  const bizno = p[3] ? p[3].trim() : '';\n  const c = cache[bizno] || {};\n  if (!c.dae || !c.jung || !c.so) {\n    missingDae.push({ idx: idx + 1, company: p[2], bizno, userInd: p[12] || p[10] || p[8] });\n  }\n});\n\nconsole.log('Missing classification count:', missingDae.length);\nif (missingDae.length > 0) {\n  missingDae.slice(0, 10).forEach(m => console.log(JSON.stringify(m)));\n}\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\import_company_database_list","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Checking missing classifications","toolSummary":"Check missing industry classifications"}}]}
