{"step_index":179,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T00:09:40Z","thinking":"**Assessing Industry Mapping Coverage**\n\nThe input data for the 25 companies each includes a `userInd` field specifying an industry. A mapping dictionary containing 222 industry mappings was loaded previously. A crucial task is to determine if this mapping can cover all 37 distinct industries present in the dataset.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Script to map all 37 industries to dae/jung/so","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\n// Load known mappings from existing project files\nconst files = ['all_500_factchecked.tsv', 'merged_500_perfect.tsv', 'bizno_filtered_result_nice.csv'];\nconst map = new Map();\n\nfiles.forEach(f => {\n  if (fs.existsSync(f)) {\n    const lines = fs.readFileSync(f, 'utf-8').split('\\n');\n    lines.forEach(l => {\n      if (f === 'merged_500_perfect.tsv' || f === 'all_500_factchecked.tsv') {\n        const p = l.split('\\t');\n        const ind = p[12]?.trim();\n        const d = p[15]?.trim();\n        const j = p[16]?.trim();\n        const s = p[17]?.trim();\n        if (ind && d && !map.has(ind)) map.set(ind, { d, j, s });\n      }\n    });\n  }\n});\n\n// Cache dae/jung/so from bizno_200_cache.json\nconst cache = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e1493fa0-e8a4-4717-a46c-5bc1b3357473/scratch/bizno_200_cache.json', 'utf-8'));\nObject.values(cache).forEach(c => {\n  if (c.industry && c.dae && c.jung && c.so && !map.has(c.industry)) {\n    map.set(c.industry, { d: c.dae, j: c.jung, s: c.so });\n  }\n});\n\n// Standard KSIC fallback table for the 37 industries\nconst standardKsic = {\n  '공기 조화장치 제조업': { d: '제조업', j: '기타 기계 및 장비 제조업', s: '일반 목적용 기계 제조업' },\n  '구름베어링 제조업': { d: '제조업', j: '기타 기계 및 장비 제조업', s: '일반 목적용 기계 제조업' },\n  '그 외 기타 일반목적용 기계 제조업': { d: '제조업', j: '기타 기계 및 장비 제조업